        "original_id": "0b78be8f-e451-5485-a972-c3cec7873d05",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Iphigénie en Tauride, Der Barbier von Bagdad\n- People: Christoph Willibald Gluck, Peter Cornelius\n- Concepts: opera, comic opera, libretto, One Thousand and One Nights\n\nFacts:\n- Iphigénie en Tauride (\"Iphigenia in Tauris\") is a 1779 opera in four acts by Christoph Willibald Gluck.\n- Der Barbier von Bagdad (\"The Barber of Baghdad\") is a comic opera in two acts by Peter Cornelius.\n- Peter Cornelius wrote the German libretto for Der Barbier von Bagdad.\n- Der Barbier von Bagdad is based on \"The Tale of the Tailor\" and \"The Barber’s Stories of his Six Brothers\" in One Thousand and One Nights.",
